  "question": {
    "text": "Molecule AB has a bond length of <math><mn>1.617</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#8491;</mi></math> and a dipole moment of 0.38 D. The fractional charge on each atom(absolute magnitude) is: <math><mo>(</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>4.802</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">u</mi><mo>)</mo></math>"
  },
